    <h1>Privacy Policy for 1nnSearch</h1>
    <p><strong>Last Updated: May 3, 2026</strong></p>

    <h2>What 1nnSearch Does</h2>
    <p>1nnSearch is a Chrome extension that fills lodging search forms on Inntopia.com
    based on shorthand text you enter (for example, dates, number of guests, destination).
    All processing happens locally inside your browser.</p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p><strong>None.</strong> No data is collected, stored, or transmitted anywhere.
    The extension does not use analytics, tracking, or any third-party services.</p>

    <h2>How Your Data is Used</h2>
    <p>Any data you type into 1nnSearch is processed only in your browser
    and is never sent to any server. The extension operates entirely offline.</p>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>This extension does not integrate with or send data to any third-party services.</p>

    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>Since no data is collected, there is no data to access, modify, or delete.
    You can uninstall the extension at any time through Chrome's extension settings.</p>

    <h2>Limited Use Compliance</h2>
    <p>The use of information received from Google APIs will adhere to the
    Chrome Web Store User Data Policy, including the Limited Use requirements.</p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted at this URL. </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions about this privacy policy, contact:
    <strong>innsearch.privacy@gmail.com</strong></p>
